# SwiftUI Rules

- Use SwiftUI for screens.
- Keep views small and readable.
- Use SwiftData for local storage when persistence is needed.
- Put business logic outside large views when it grows.
- Do not create duplicate models.
- Keep names clear and simple.
- Add comments only when the code is not obvious.

